source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A character reference keeps `h1.` off the line start and shows no extra character, which is how the renderer protects a paragraph.
-- input.jira --
h1&#46; x
-- rendered.html --
<p>h1&#46; x</p>
-- want.md --
h1&#46; x
